          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" id="q-class-times" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" tabindex="-1">
      <h3 itemprop="name">What time are classes in Gdynia?</h3>
      <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <div itemprop="text">
          <p>
            Aikido training in Gdynia takes place on the following days and times:
          </p>
