    <div class="faq-item" id="q-cost" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" tabindex="-1">
      <h3 itemprop="name">How much does Aikido training cost in Gdynia?</h3>
      <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <div itemprop="text">
          <p>
            <strong>The first class is free!</strong> This is a great opportunity to try Aikido 
